{"reviewId": "267600102_87QatEJuK", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 14, "content": "工业国经济不好 → 它们买大宗商品变少 → 大宗商品价格跌 → 美元更强势。\n\n举例：想象一个工厂老板：\n他要经常买原材料（大宗商品）\n原材料用美元计价\n美元强势 = 他买同样的原材料更贵\n他自己经济不好 = 没能力多买原材料\n结果：\n他越难赚钱，美元越强势，他越买不起原材料\n\n简短总结：\n美元强 = 全球经济弱\n工业国弱 = 买大宗商品少\n大宗商品跌 = 美元更强\n形成恶性循环\n个人理解：美元降息，美元变弱，大宗商品涨价。（方向对，但不一定只有这一种情况，但是放在2026年当年应该是合理的）", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "。", "range": "9237-9238", "chapterName": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "chapterIdx": 14, "reviewId": "267600102_87QatEJuK", "userVid": 267600102, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774335359, "userEditTime": 1774335827, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第二部分 大类资产配置", "author": {"userVid": 267600102, "name": "清清", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0019-FfPbM3OlWKsVkp383Llw_bc/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "清清", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-100", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 7, "likes": [{"userVid": 211979211, "name": "蜡妹小欣", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/78EkX665csCnhF3ic21HRJFL2EIdUPG3xnKSoDSOFq5dmrETnQFpIK5e841j3n64vF2I2JlwUEKs/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "为啥大宗商品跌=美元强，这个逻辑没懂", "reviewId": "267600102_87QatEJuK", "com